        "text": "**Defining Platform Generation**\n\nI've begun implementation with `stream_platform_generation.py`, clearly using `vertexai.preview.generative_models` and \"gemini-pro\" for Google Cloud's Generative AI. The code contains an explicit provider reference and placeholders for the `PROJECT_ID`.\n\n\n**Implementing Platform Generation**\n\nI've successfully created the `stream_platform_generation.py` script. It's set up to use `vertexai.preview.generative_models` and the \"gemini-pro\" model from Google Cloud. Provider details are clear and placeholders are ready for the user to configure. I've also incorporated placeholders for PROJECT_ID and LOCATION.\n\n\n",
