      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Model Resolution Provider**\n\nI'm focusing on making the provider, Google Cloud's Vertex AI, explicitly identifiable within the Python file `select_platform_resource.py`. The goal is to design the code around the resolution of a model using Vertex AI.\n\n\n**Identifying Vertex AI Implementation**\n\nI'm now concretely identifying the external provider as Vertex AI within `select_platform_resource.py`. The focus is to ensure the code revolves around Vertex AI's model resolution. I've formulated a plan to create the file and define the `resolve_model` function, taking a model name and returning a resolved resource identifier. Provider-specific identifiers like `google.cloud.aiplatform` will be integrated.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
